  <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
  <p>
    By accessing or using CrockBites (<a href="https://crockbites.pages.dev/">crockbites.pages.dev</a> and our canonical domain <a href="https://crockbites.site/">crockbites.site</a>), you agree to these Terms of Use and our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree with these terms, please discontinue use of the site.
