  <h2>2. Culinary Content, Food Safety &amp; Nutrition Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    All recipes, slow-cooker timing guides, allergen declarations, dietary labels, and nutrition estimates on CrockBites are provided for informational and home-cooking purposes only:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Food Safety:</strong> Slow cookers, stovetops, and ovens vary by manufacturer, wattage, and altitude. You are responsible for following safe food-handling practices and verifying safe minimum internal cooking temperatures with an instant-read food thermometer (for example, 165&deg;F / 74&deg;C for poultry and leftovers, and 160&deg;F / 71&deg;C for ground beef and pork). See our <a href="/guides/slow-cooker-food-safety/">Slow Cooker Food Safety Guide</a> for details.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Nutrition &amp; Allergens:</strong> Nutrition Facts and dietary or allergen badges are provided as good-faith references based on standard USDA ingredient data and editorial review. Always inspect specific product packaging and ingredient labels in your kitchen, especially when cooking for someone with a severe food allergy or medical dietary restriction. Nothing on CrockBites constitutes medical or dietetic advice.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Member Accounts &amp; Security</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You must provide accurate information when registering an account and keep your login credentials confidential.</li>
    <li>You may not impersonate another person, register automated or bulk accounts, or attempt to bypass authentication, CSRF protections, or rate limits.</li>
    <li>You may close and permanently delete your account at any time from your <a href="/account/profile/">Profile &amp; Settings</a> page.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Community Reviews &amp; User Content</h2>
  <p>
    Signed-in members may submit star ratings and written reviews on published recipes. Reviews are published immediately upon submission:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>One Review Per Recipe:</strong> Each member may maintain one active review per recipe, which you can edit or delete at any time directly on the recipe page or in your <a href="/account/reviews/">My Reviews</a> dashboard.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Community Standards:</strong> Reviews must reflect genuine feedback or questions about the recipe. You may not post unlawful, defamatory, abusive, promotional, or spam content, or include malicious links or scripts.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>License &amp; Moderation:</strong> By posting a review, you grant CrockBites a non-exclusive, royalty-free, worldwide license to display your review, rating, and display name on the platform. We reserve the right to remove any review that violates these Terms or suspend accounts engaged in abuse.
    </li>
  </ul>

